The problem is that when you use the HackWB interface the information attached
to the game icon supercedes that in the NetHack.cnf file.  You need to set
PATH=nethack:;hackexe: in the NEWGAME.INFO file... or if you are using HackCLI
just putting it in the nethack.cnf file will suffice.  Don't quote me on the
semi-colon format, but that's what I recall from when I worked this all out
several months back.
